{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43294","headline":"暗投明珠 · 罗泰","name":"暗投明珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"媚川时未识，在掌共传名。\n报德能欺暗，投人自欲明。\n月临幽室朗，星没晓河倾。\n的皪骊龙颔，荧煌彩凤呈。\n守恩辞合浦，擅美掩连城。\n鱼目应难近，谁知按劒情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗泰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}